# Configuration for parallel Kurtosis testnet networks.
# Format: MODEL|ENCLAVE_NAME|RPC_URL|PRIVATE_KEY
#
# To retrieve the RPC port for each enclave:
#   kurtosis enclave inspect <ENCLAVE_NAME>
#   -> locate service "el-1-geth-..." -> Ports column -> rpc: 8545/tcp -> 127.0.0.1:<HOST_PORT>
#
# PRIVATE_KEY is the private key of the pre-funded genesis account.

